	quest.0000000000000230.title: "&dOffering&r Table"
	quest.00000000000002B5.quest_desc: ["Grown by the Ritual of the Forest from a &dPurple Archwood Sapling&r, then built up with planks, stone bricks and Golden Bricks. Items placed on it soak up the aura around it."]
