	quest.127E718DDB80BC89.quest_desc: [
		"The \"Tree of Knowledge\" questline is designed to be stepping stones for the progression points of Impostor Syndrome."
		""
		"Down the middle you'll find all the core mods you need to progress through, and a rough order you'll go through them. Depending on whether or not you ungated your content this tree will either be crucial to your gameplay, or just a nice guiding system."
		""
		"On the left you'll see some independent quests. These quests represent the many storage options available in the pack and are placed to match roughly where in the progression tree they can be unlocked/accessed. You don't have to use every single one, but some of them may require basic components from a previous tier to be used."
		""
		"On the right you'll see a couple optional quests. Like the storage quests, these are placed relative to where you should be unlocking them in progression. These quests are mostly optional (to an extent) and are more of a reminder that you now have access to this resource and should be taking advantage of it."
	]
	quest.127E718DDB80BC89.quest_subtitle: "The manuscript for success"
	quest.127E718DDB80BC89.title: "The Tree of Knowledge"
	quest.12890D43E938BA82.title: "&aExplorer's&r Compass"
