	quest.3D4296467C5BA586.quest_desc: [
		"Now this is a major step up for storage!"
		""
		"Occultism's Dimensional Storage is a storage multiblock with lots of strong possibilities! The storage actuator acts as the center point of this system. The way this system works is similar to AE2 storage. By default, the actuator holds up to 128 different item types and 256,000 items in total. Storage stabilizers placed around it raise both limits, and the tiers can be mixed."
		""
		"Each tier of stabilizer adds the following:"
		""
		"Tier 1 - 64 item types, 512,000 items"
		"Tier 2 - 128 item types, 1,024,000 items"
		"Tier 3 - 256 item types, 2,048,000 items"
		"Tier 4 - 512 item types, 4,096,000 items"
		"Tier 5 - 1,024 item types, 8,192,000 items"
		""
		"On top of all that lovely storage space, you can also set up autocrafting using demons! There's lots of possibilities in that area, so I highly recommend taking a look at the Dictionary of Spirits for more information."
	]
