	quest.41A300005988B516.quest_desc: [
		"For a long time I thought these colorful orbs were just a side effect of speaking with the dark lord."
		""
		"As it turns out, he holds no power over them. These \"nodes\" seem to be created by the overflowing energy of this world. Perhaps I can tap into this energy, imbue my technology even further with the power of this world's nature. Only time will tell."
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"ElementalCraft\" chapter!"
	]
	quest.41A300005988B516.quest_subtitle: "It finally makes sense!"
