	quest.42143230213041BB.quest_desc: [
		"Wait, no, it's not in the air, it is the air!"
		""
		"Why didn't we think of this sooner! We know that the huge amounts of pressure from the deep ocean have affected creatures of our world, so why not use the endless air to try and simulate that pressure for our testing?!"
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"Pneumaticcraft\" chapter!"
	]
