	quest.4691EFDFB8D768A9.quest_desc: [
		"Are our bodies containers for our souls, or are they more than that?"
		""
		"It's about time we start experimenting a little bit more with the resources we have available. Some of the creatures of this land seem to bleed, I wonder if their blood is the same as mine?"
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"Bloody Arcana\" chapter!"
	]
