	quest.46A80AF718AB2C5C.quest_desc: [
		"I invoked the old law, and even then I am unsatisfied."
		""
		"I was blinded by what I believed to be my success. That measly stone does not create, it simply converts. I cannot yet manipulate nothing into something, but at the very least it has brought me one step closer. With the stone in hand I have finally reached the pinnacle of creation. This new table will allow me to once again merge all my previous efforts and create what I've been searching for from the beginning. Perfection."
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"Extended Crafting\" chapter!"
	]
