	quest.4B0204D805F8A629.title: "&bCrystalline&r Machines"
	quest.4B05D6EB1962E978.quest_desc: [
		"The stone of the sealed world gave my machines new life, and nature itself has started answering me. Still, it isn't enough. I want more."
		""
		"Diamonds empowered until they hum, pressed into a lattice and bound together with the stars I tore from the Wither. The crystal that forms feels endless, almost hungry. Is this what greed looks like when it finally takes shape?"
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"Avaritia\" chapter!"
	]
	quest.4B05D6EB1962E978.quest_subtitle: "Greed is good"
	quest.4B0C2EA3553652B7.quest_desc: ["Links energy crystals to each other and to the machines they power. Crystal networks can carry energy anywhere without cables."]
	quest.4B0C2EA3553652B7.quest_subtitle: "Making Connections"
	quest.4B0C2EA3553652B7.title: "&bCrystal&r Binder"
	quest.4B11034D9DD1CA1E.title: "&cRaw&r Crimson Iron"
	quest.4B25E302A39C51AB.title: "&5Misfortune&r Plate"
	quest.4B3A1E392D127CCC.quest_desc: [
		"Certain quests in the Tree of Knowledge are more \"important\" than others. These quests are diamond-shaped, and completing one sets your difficulty level to a fixed number."
		""
		"The quests with difficulty level changes are listed below, as well as what level they set your difficulty to."
		""
		"Ender IO - 25"
		"Aether - 35"
		"Industrial Foregoing - 50"
		"The End - 75"
		"Avaritia - 150"
		"The Undergarden - 300"
	]
	quest.4B3A1E392D127CCC.quest_subtitle: "Keeping you on your toes!"
	quest.4B3A1E392D127CCC.title: "Difficulty Milestones"
	quest.4B4E270489DFE512.title: "&cNitro&r Energy Cell"
	quest.4B553343BDE7D9B4.quest_desc: ["A regular injector marked with &9Draconium Dust&r so the &dFusion Package Crafter&r can use it. Craft it on its own to get the normal injector back."]
	quest.4B553343BDE7D9B4.quest_subtitle: "Tier I Automation"
	quest.4B553343BDE7D9B4.title: "&dMarked&r &9Draconium&r Injector"
	quest.4B836CF50F15E47E.quest_desc: ["Add a spike, a horn and a wing to summon the &cWilden Chimera&r."]
	quest.4B836CF50F15E47E.title: "&2Ritual&r of the Wild"
	quest.4B85D83C46CDB7E5.title: "&6Medium&r Tank"
	quest.4B9453FA92DD763F.title: "&4A New Recruit&r for the Dark"
	quest.4B9A5E222F19B674.quest_desc: [
		"As expected, I conquered the beast."
		""
		"Out of all my foes, he fought the hardest. I remain alive, but not unscathed, and the scars he's left will forever be a symbol of the love he had for his wife."
		""
		"It seems much like her, he was also protecting something. Not a child, but a crystal of pure chaos. Did he let it take over when he discovered her? Is this where all his power came from? I do not know. I do know however that I can use it to my advantage. A sliver of this power combined with the power of my own creation should yield fascinating results. Finally, I can see the end of this odyssey."
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"Powah\" chapter!"
	]
