	quest.5253862717229B37.quest_desc: [
		"I did it. I finally did it. Yet even now, I am unsatisfied."
		""
		"I have defeated all the beasts, spirits, Gods and relics of these lands. I have discovered new technologies, and ones long forgotten. I have manipulated time, space, and the will of existence. I have gained the ability to create endlessness out of nothingness, and yet I feel like a fraud."
		""
		"Am I truly powerful now? Am I the God I strived to become? Was all of this truly my doing, or was it luck that had her way?"
		""
		"This is the end of my journey. I lived as a man, followed the path of the Gods, yet in the end I am nothing but an Impostor."
	]
	quest.5253862717229B37.quest_subtitle: "The culmination."
