	quest.56F8F2E6D45B9900.quest_desc: [
		"It seems my intuition was correct, retracing my steps was the best course of action."
		""
		"With my new advancements in crafting I was able to discover yet another world hidden behind the secrets of this one. I decided to retrace my steps even further, back to the grave of the so-called beast, and that's when I heard his cry. Louder than the final breath of any of the other gods I've faced thus far, louder than the combined cries of every single one of my test subjects, louder even than when the dark lord invades my mind."
		""
		"It turns out my lonely friend was not so lonely after all, it makes sense that she'd have a partner to procreate with, but her death has done nothing but fill her partner with anguish, sorrow, and a pure unbridled hatred. A hatred towards me."
		""
		"It is unfortunate, but it seems only one of us will leave this place alive, and today is not the day I die."
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"Draconic Evolution\" chapter!"
	]
	quest.56F8F2E6D45B9900.quest_subtitle: "Retracing my steps"
