	quest.7A20F5EAA29FF46B.quest_subtitle: "Still under construction!"
	quest.7A20F5EAA29FF46B.title: "Version Info"
	quest.7A32764949BB99E2.quest_desc: [
		"Incredible. I've pushed it even further again, but I am not yet satisfied. It is not enough."
		""
		"Through my explorations of the deepest parts of this world it never crossed my mind to explore the depths of the ocean. Clearly that was a mistake, as this exploration has led to the discovery of even more lifeforms that I had yet to see. This mistake made me think though, am I perhaps missing more? It's time to go back to the basics and reform the way I research."
		""
		"More information can be found in the \"Extended Crafting \\& Undergarden\" chapters!"
	]
	quest.7A32764949BB99E2.quest_subtitle: "Nothing deeper than the ocean"
