	quest.7AF4D0431578BDF2.quest_desc: ["Quests in the shape of a square are called \"Support Quests\". These quests are meant to assist you in some way. This could be as simple as just offering information, or fixing bugged progression unlocks. Keep an eye out for these!"]
	quest.7AF4D0431578BDF2.quest_subtitle: "What do these squares mean?!"
	quest.7AF4D0431578BDF2.title: "Support Quests"
	quest.7AF8DE339DC4F1F0.quest_desc: [
		"If I've learned anything throughout this existence it's that there's always something deeper."
		""
		"These lands are teeming with \"beasts\" that resemble the mother that was previously imprisoned. Some breathe fire, some breathe ice, and some carry the storm itself. Perhaps she was never the only one of her kind, just the first one I found."
		""
		"Their blood is remarkable. Worked into metal in the heat of their own breath, it hardens into a steel unlike anything I've made before. If I'm to push my machines any further, I'll need all three."
	]
	quest.7AF8DE339DC4F1F0.quest_subtitle: "An uncanny resemblance"
